WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:07.708
AI Cybersecurity Agents™. Autonomous cybersecurity, custom designed for your website.

2
00:00:07.808 --> 00:00:14.700
Like a video game, but no player is needed. The agent plays it on its own. First, it predicts.

3
00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:21.656
It checks for new versions every day and holds a virtual patch for known patterns.

4
00:00:21.756 --> 00:00:31.756
Then it intercepts, at the speed of light. Floods, SQL injections, probes for files that should never be seen. The agent counts.

5
00:00:31.756 --> 00:00:39.686
One address sent 120 requests. Blocked at request 101. A SQL probe, blocked.

6
00:00:39.786 --> 00:00:48.306
Then it thwarts. The attack fails. The site stays up. A test malware file restored in about 3 seconds.

7
00:00:48.406 --> 00:00:56.758
My grandfather worked on guidance systems. He built them to follow exact rules. I designed mine for websites.

8
00:00:56.858 --> 00:01:07.610
And it gets smarter. The first time a new attack pattern appears, the agent creates a virtual patch rule for it on its own. I review it after.

9
00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:17.974
Autonomous defense that watches for incoming attacks day and night, recognizes a new pattern, and blocks it on its own.

10
00:01:17.974 --> 00:01:23.134
I review everything it does. A super dome for your website.

11
00:01:23.134 --> 00:01:29.330
See the live demo. Read the build demonstration. Book a free 15-minute discovery call.
